WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.500
One task, end to end.

2
00:00:05.392 --> 00:00:07.020
01 · Request — One sentence starts the task.

3
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:10.562
02 · Context — It reads the project before it proposes anything.

4
00:00:10.762 --> 00:00:15.867
03 · Reproduce — The failing check, reproduced first.

5
00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:19.117
04 · Plan — A plan you can read before a file changes.

6
00:00:19.317 --> 00:00:23.467
05 · Fix — The change arrives as a diff, not a claim.

7
00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:27.664
06 · Verify — The check that failed now passes.

8
00:00:27.864 --> 00:00:31.454
07 · Notes — The result is a file you keep.

9
00:00:31.654 --> 00:00:37.600
08 · Approval — Anything that leaves the machine waits for you.

10
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.000
Your open workspace for AI agents.
